(5870482, 853882, 92403, '<td valign="top">you can''t really mess up Frank Gerry''s stuff, but this to me looks like absolute perfection. congrats!</td>', 'you can''t really mess up Frank Gerry''s stuff, but this to me looks like absolute perfection. congrats!', '2010-02-17 02:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
