(5870494, 854707, 92403, '<td valign="top">and I would love to see them personally... great capture</td>', 'and I would love to see them personally... great capture', '2010-02-17 02:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870499, 853909, 92403, '<td valign="top">Escher would be proud...</td>', 'Escher would be proud...', '2010-02-17 02:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870614, 853518, 101849, '<td valign="top">Just loved visting this bridge in NY. One of the most picture perfect spots ever.</td>', 'Just loved visting this bridge in NY. One of the most picture perfect spots ever.', '2010-02-17 03:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870619, 854761, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and impressive photo.  Can''t really work out how you pulled it off.  At first I thought it was a fake tap with some grinding conducted on the other side of the wall being directed to go through the tap.  But then I noticed the gap between the sparks and the tap.<br/> <br/>Anyway, you''ve been very clever and met the intent of the subject better than most of what I''ve seen so far.  It''s an 8 from me.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very interesting and impressive photo.  Can''t really work out how you pulled it off.  At first I thought it was a fake tap with some grinding conducted on the other side of the wall being directed to go through the tap.  But then I noticed the gap between the sparks and the tap. Anyway, you''ve been very clever and met the intent of the subject better than most of what I''ve seen so far.  It''s an 8 from me.  Good luck!', '2010-02-17 03:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870623, 854530, 64670, '<td valign="top">Love it, love it, LOVE IT!</td>', 'Love it, love it, LOVE IT!', '2010-02-17 04:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870641, 853518, 40391, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasts. At first I thought it was a bit over exposed but the more I looked - the more I liked.  However, what''s happening with the lower arc? It looks a little out of shape.</td>', 'Love the contrasts. At first I thought it was a bit over exposed but the more I looked - the more I liked.  However, what''s happening with the lower arc? It looks a little out of shape.', '2010-02-17 04:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870646, 854755, 40391, '<td valign="top">On my computer your photo subject first appeared a little too centred.  But then I scrolled down and realised there was more to see. Then I scrolled even further and now feel there is a fraction too much foreground for me. I still like the photo, especially the tones.</td>', 'On my computer your photo subject first appeared a little too centred.  But then I scrolled down and realised there was more to see. Then I scrolled even further and now feel there is a fraction too much foreground for me. I still like the photo, especially the tones.', '2010-02-17 04:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
