(5871115, 853909, 112107, '<td valign="top">8*.<br/>Great dynamics. Beautifull B&amp;W. I just wish you had used a more timeless pen and a hairless harm (the drawn hands look more feminine).<br/>A fan nonetheless.</td>', '8*.Great dynamics. Beautifull B&W. I just wish you had used a more timeless pen and a hairless harm (the drawn hands look more feminine).A fan nonetheless.', '2010-02-17 14:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871168, 853570, 111123, '<td valign="top">I love black &amp; white, very nice.</td>', 'I love black & white, very nice.', '2010-02-17 15:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871216, 853570, 58691, '<td valign="top">It may just be me, but I am drawn in more by the tree and the snow than by the the church.</td>', 'It may just be me, but I am drawn in more by the tree and the snow than by the the church.', '2010-02-17 16:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871220, 853966, 58691, '<td valign="top">The large amount of wasted space at the bottom of the image doesn''t complement the top half of the photo. There is a nice shot within this image - the woman in blue passing by the mosque, directly under the marquee - but I realize that wouldn''t necessarily meet the challenge. Additionally, the building on the left doesn''t make an impact and if the image was cropped to remove that, the main section of the mosque would be much more impactful.</td>', 'The large amount of wasted space at the bottom of the image doesn''t complement the top half of the photo. There is a nice shot within this image - the woman in blue passing by the mosque, directly under the marquee - but I realize that wouldn''t necessarily meet the challenge. Additionally, the building on the left doesn''t make an impact and if the image was cropped to remove that, the main section of the mosque would be much more impactful.', '2010-02-17 16:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871221, 854468, 33672, '<td valign="top">Hardcore Riders!</td>', 'Hardcore Riders!', '2010-02-17 16:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871222, 853882, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Shadows</td>', 'Beautiful Shadows', '2010-02-17 16:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871226, 854646, 58691, '<td valign="top">So with this title are you saying that one of the primary anthropomorphic archetypes of the unconscious mind was constructed by man? I think that is a bit of a stretch - more likely it was revealed, theorized or imagined by man, but not constructed. It is part of the human psyche/condition and therefore a product of nature.</td>', 'So with this title are you saying that one of the primary anthropomorphic archetypes of the unconscious mind was constructed by man? I think that is a bit of a stretch - more likely it was revealed, theorized or imagined by man, but not constructed. It is part of the human psyche/condition and therefore a product of nature.', '2010-02-17 16:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871227, 854761, 58691, '<td valign="top">Creative concept, execution is a bit "blah"</td>', 'Creative concept, execution is a bit "blah"', '2010-02-17 16:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871232, 854657, 58691, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this image. Phenomenal job.</td>', 'Absolutely love this image. Phenomenal job.', '2010-02-17 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871235, 854563, 58691, '<td valign="top">I''m drawn more by the backdrop (nature) than the silhouetted man-made structures, but otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'I''m drawn more by the backdrop (nature) than the silhouetted man-made structures, but otherwise a nice shot.', '2010-02-17 16:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871240, 854319, 30446, '<td valign="top">too busy, too much going on at once...</td>', 'too busy, too much going on at once...', '2010-02-17 16:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871244, 854435, 58691, '<td valign="top">Good concept here, but would help greatly if we could see the entirety of the structure/artwork</td>', 'Good concept here, but would help greatly if we could see the entirety of the structure/artwork', '2010-02-17 17:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871246, 854591, 58691, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The tilted horizon may lose you a few points, but other than that it is well executed and creative shot.</td>', 'Very nice. The tilted horizon may lose you a few points, but other than that it is well executed and creative shot.', '2010-02-17 17:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871250, 854330, 58691, '<td valign="top">Excellent silhouette, but am drawn more to the sun and to the bird than to the dome and other structures. Overall it is one of the top images submitted to the challenge, but it does not convey the theme well enough to make it a top scorer... but close.</td>', 'Excellent silhouette, but am drawn more to the sun and to the bird than to the dome and other structures. Overall it is one of the top images submitted to the challenge, but it does not convey the theme well enough to make it a top scorer... but close.', '2010-02-17 17:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871260, 854596, 58691, '<td valign="top">Unique concept, but that white background, especially against the blurry yellow and red petals is painful to the eyes. The lack of human interaction also hurts this. If a hand was placing a petal, that would give the image some "life". As is, the elements are disconnected, figuratively.</td>', 'Unique concept, but that white background, especially against the blurry yellow and red petals is painful to the eyes. The lack of human interaction also hurts this. If a hand was placing a petal, that would give the image some "life". As is, the elements are disconnected, figuratively.', '2010-02-17 17:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871263, 853585, 58691, '<td valign="top">Yes, but still constructed by nature.</td>', 'Yes, but still constructed by nature.', '2010-02-17 17:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871270, 854716, 105457, '<td valign="top">Hello Duarte ;)<br/> <br/>It looks just like a urban snake, I never thought of having it photographed like this, it''s the most unique perspective of this tower!<br/>It''s a pity that the top was dark, it would have so much more impact, but still it''s a very different approach.<br/>Boa sorte!</td>', 'Hello Duarte ;) It looks just like a urban snake, I never thought of having it photographed like this, it''s the most unique perspective of this tower!It''s a pity that the top was dark, it would have so much more impact, but still it''s a very different approach.Boa sorte!', '2010-02-17 17:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871293, 854361, 10523, '<td valign="top">great B&amp;W- top 10</td>', 'great B&W- top 10', '2010-02-17 17:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
