(5871360, 854772, 10785, '<td valign="top">I get by your title that this is a university and the architecture supports that to a degree. I think the photo needs a little more context such as some people studying. It does meet the challenge and there are some interesting leading lines and curves shown. It''s somewhat underexposed in that the foreground area is dark but you had to do that in order to get the background to not be way too blown out. Nice job with a difficult subject.</td>', 'I get by your title that this is a university and the architecture supports that to a degree. I think the photo needs a little more context such as some people studying. It does meet the challenge and there are some interesting leading lines and curves shown. It''s somewhat underexposed in that the foreground area is dark but you had to do that in order to get the background to not be way too blown out. Nice job with a difficult subject.', '2010-02-17 19:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871362, 854657, 10785, '<td valign="top">Quite the laser light show! Looks like some camera movement or zook blur. Awesome job!</td>', 'Quite the laser light show! Looks like some camera movement or zook blur. Awesome job!', '2010-02-17 19:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871367, 853518, 10785, '<td valign="top">I have seen this bridge a lot lately, not only here but pictured on TV and what not. It is so lovely! You did a nic job with yor perspective and I love the captured snow!</td>', 'I have seen this bridge a lot lately, not only here but pictured on TV and what not. It is so lovely! You did a nic job with yor perspective and I love the captured snow!', '2010-02-17 19:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871369, 853649, 10785, '<td valign="top">There is a focus point here and I think it is on the far left pencil eraser in the foreground. It is such a short focal length that the entire photo looks out of focus. I would have probably focused on the brand name on the top pencil or something.</td>', 'There is a focus point here and I think it is on the far left pencil eraser in the foreground. It is such a short focal length that the entire photo looks out of focus. I would have probably focused on the brand name on the top pencil or something.', '2010-02-17 19:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5871371, 854305, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting light!</td>', 'Interesting light!', '2010-02-17 19:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
