(5871715, 853518, 111808, '<td valign="top">How beautiful this is in its flowing lines of the bridge, arch repetitions &amp; delicate lacework of the trees. The snow adds a depth of extraordinary vision &amp; Magick, like the sprinkled dusting in the centre. The tones of the black &amp; white really bring this out as does how it is composed. SUPERB.</td>', 'How beautiful this is in its flowing lines of the bridge, arch repetitions & delicate lacework of the trees. The snow adds a depth of extraordinary vision & Magick, like the sprinkled dusting in the centre. The tones of the black & white really bring this out as does how it is composed. SUPERB.', '2010-02-17 23:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
