(5871856, 853989, 54645, '<td valign="top">Another image open to interpretation.The stain is a ghost, a young man or woman left behind, or remnants of a dorm room wall. You know this will bomb, but I like the interpretation. 9</td>', 'Another image open to interpretation.The stain is a ghost, a young man or woman left behind, or remnants of a dorm room wall. You know this will bomb, but I like the interpretation. 9', '2010-02-18 01:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
