(5872031, 854658, 32767, '<td valign="top">I like the image but I have to say it''s rather stark. The background adds some context but a more identifiable human element might have bundled it differently, lending the shot some warmth. I''ve shot it a number of times and waited to get a person in frame...peeking through the window or something but nothing rocked me.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=753407" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Crazy tilt attempt...</a></td>', 'I like the image but I have to say it''s rather stark. The background adds some context but a more identifiable human element might have bundled it differently, lending the shot some warmth. I''ve shot it a number of times and waited to get a person in frame...peeking through the window or something but nothing rocked me. Crazy tilt attempt...', '2010-02-18 07:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5872057, 853989, 110041, '<td valign="top">A hint of Tracey Emin with this one.<br/> <br/>Tells a story (which is a relatively uncommon trait for photos on this site).<br/> <br/>I don''t really want to think about those stains too much either.<br/> <br/>A really tricky one to vote on.</td>', 'A hint of Tracey Emin with this one. Tells a story (which is a relatively uncommon trait for photos on this site). I don''t really want to think about those stains too much either. A really tricky one to vote on.', '2010-02-18 08:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
