(5876181, 854784, 114056, '<td valign="top">That is a very bright looking city, you might want to try a different aperture or shorter exposure. I see what you''re trying to do however it''s coming up very hazy from the light hitting pollution. Also, your colour balance is out, if you make the lights more white a lot of the haze goes away (the cooler image gives a lot more definition).</td>', 'That is a very bright looking city, you might want to try a different aperture or shorter exposure. I see what you''re trying to do however it''s coming up very hazy from the light hitting pollution. Also, your colour balance is out, if you make the lights more white a lot of the haze goes away (the cooler image gives a lot more definition).', '2010-02-22 04:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
