(5878363, 854761, 112739, '<td valign="top">I''m trying really hard to get this image, but I just don''t see what you were trying to do or how you did it? Does it meet the challenge of being Constructed by Man? I guess the brick wall does.</td>', 'I''m trying really hard to get this image, but I just don''t see what you were trying to do or how you did it? Does it meet the challenge of being Constructed by Man? I guess the brick wall does.', '2010-02-23 22:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
