(5879297, 854725, 113278, '<td valign="top">I think this should have placed much higher. I love your use of leading lines and lovely B&amp;W shot.</td>', 'I think this should have placed much higher. I love your use of leading lines and lovely B&W shot.', '2010-02-24 12:49:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5879300, 853649, 113278, '<td valign="top">IMHO I think the different lines just confuse the eye. I just don''t know where to look and there doesn''t seem to be a real focal point. It was different so I like that. keep it up and congrats on a new personal best.</td>', 'IMHO I think the different lines just confuse the eye. I just don''t know where to look and there doesn''t seem to be a real focal point. It was different so I like that. keep it up and congrats on a new personal best.', '2010-02-24 12:52:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5879305, 854279, 113278, '<td valign="top">I think your comp was really good with this the issue I have is the blown out sky. This shot with the angle and title would be amazing if done at sunset or sunrise when you could take advantage of the orange and yellow colors. Keep up the good work and may I just say Wow at all the comments you are making, that is awesome.</td>', 'I think your comp was really good with this the issue I have is the blown out sky. This shot with the angle and title would be amazing if done at sunset or sunrise when you could take advantage of the orange and yellow colors. Keep up the good work and may I just say Wow at all the comments you are making, that is awesome.', '2010-02-24 12:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5879319, 854391, 113419, '<td valign="top">LOL  Now I''m laughing at you''re comment about "Natures Flasher" - funny!</td>', 'LOL  Now I''m laughing at you''re comment about "Natures Flasher" - funny!', '2010-02-24 13:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
