(5879459, 854623, 105466, '<td valign="top">Thank you folks for kind comments and generous scores.</td>', 'Thank you folks for kind comments and generous scores.', '2010-02-24 14:18:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5879502, 854452, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I like the warmness of the building contrasted against the blue of the sky.  Also, like another commenter mentioned, the sky and upper part of the building look just a tad grainy -- perhaps from post-processing?  And it seems tilted to the right just a hair to me, but that may just be me; I''m starting to think my head is crooked.  Otherwise, this would make an excellent postcard or advertisement for the building.  Having the water in the foreground, tree on the left and other construction on the right helps to establish a sense of scale.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice shot!  I like the warmness of the building contrasted against the blue of the sky.  Also, like another commenter mentioned, the sky and upper part of the building look just a tad grainy -- perhaps from post-processing?  And it seems tilted to the right just a hair to me, but that may just be me; I''m starting to think my head is crooked.  Otherwise, this would make an excellent postcard or advertisement for the building.  Having the water in the foreground, tree on the left and other construction on the right helps to establish a sense of scale.  Good work.', '2010-02-24 14:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5879504, 853935, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent panning shot -- these are truly boogers to get and get well.  I like the vibrance of the blue and the splashes of color in the background.  It is just a tad dark to me, but that may just be a personal thing.</td>', 'Excellent panning shot -- these are truly boogers to get and get well.  I like the vibrance of the blue and the splashes of color in the background.  It is just a tad dark to me, but that may just be a personal thing.', '2010-02-24 14:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5879548, 854466, 31664, '<td valign="top">2 blues in two weeks, wow.  Congrats and lovely shot.</td>', '2 blues in two weeks, wow.  Congrats and lovely shot.', '2010-02-24 14:54:35.000000', NULL, 0),
