(5879568, 854780, 113419, '<td valign="top">I feel that the negative space took away some of the impact of this photo.  Of course, the black and white was the only way to go with this!  What a wonderful feeling of movement.  How was it created?</td>', 'I feel that the negative space took away some of the impact of this photo.  Of course, the black and white was the only way to go with this!  What a wonderful feeling of movement.  How was it created?', '2010-02-24 15:13:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5879569, 853706, 113419, '<td valign="top">As was already mentioned the lighting was tough on this.  And after reading your "photographers comments" I see that you''ve been in area that has lately been plagued with overcast skies.  (I sympathize as I''ve had the skies working against me as well.)  Sometimes there are things you just can''t adjust; yet still this was nicely done.</td>', 'As was already mentioned the lighting was tough on this.  And after reading your "photographers comments" I see that you''ve been in area that has lately been plagued with overcast skies.  (I sympathize as I''ve had the skies working against me as well.)  Sometimes there are things you just can''t adjust; yet still this was nicely done.', '2010-02-24 15:16:06.000000', NULL, 0),
