(5881369, 853882, 52549, '<td valign="top">Fascinating and beautiful. I could look at this for hours, the b/w is perfect. Congrats on the (very) well deserved ribbon, Ben.</td>', 'Fascinating and beautiful. I could look at this for hours, the b/w is perfect. Congrats on the (very) well deserved ribbon, Ben.', '2010-02-26 03:18:19.000000', NULL, 0),
